{"title":"Euc20205/Sub-Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euc20205/Sub-Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all pairs of (x,y,z) given:\n</p>\n<pre><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/a/f7ad4a63898a697b2d37f657fe4c578c6f0e07fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)(y-2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/9/eb9842204b0dd1b2b6eb8944227290787189240a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-3)(z+2) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/d/e7d5911dce3b8036ccb83cf15402edac74ae1a57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + yz = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n</pre>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Euc20205/Sub-Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hx4-y_SipFc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Hx4-y_SipFc</a>\n</p><p>~ NAMCG\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/Euclid_2020/Problem_5\">Back to the previous page</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018083658\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 20/1000000\nPos